<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114551" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χραύω</span></b>  (this pres.
		implied by impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέχραυε,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχραύω</span>
			), <i>scrape, graze, wound slightly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅν ῥά τε ποιμὴν . . χραύσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα χραύσαντα δαΐξῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					11.76
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχραυσεν,</span> glossed by
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέτυχεν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 c. gen., of lands, <i>touch, be adjacent to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χραυόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Cypr.</u>
					135.9
				</span></i>
			 H.; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χραυζόμενον</span></b> 
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
